{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbt","name":"Biblica® 聖經，當代譯本開放資源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBT","englishName":"Chinese, Mandarin: Biblica® 聖經,當代譯本開放資源 (Bible)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"b36dae22680d13a66a36842989888505161ddf7eefb726364331d95aae2197c4","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"ZEP","translationId":"cmn_cbt","name":"西番雅書","commonName":"西番雅書","title":"西番雅書","order":36,"numberOfChapters":3,"sha256":"831988651ecf9325c83dd1e77b70d29c47c26109148cecfe009029ff5637d6c2","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ZEP/1.json","lastChapterNumber":3,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ZEP/3.json","totalNumberOfVerses":51},"chapter":{"number":1,"content":[{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["亞們的兒子猶大王約西亞執政期間，耶和華的話傳給了希西迦的玄孫、亞瑪利亞的曾孫、基大利的孫子、古示的兒子西番雅。"]},{"type":"heading","content":["耶和華審判的日子"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"text":"耶和華說：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"「我必毀滅地上的一切。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必毀滅人類、獸類、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"天上的鳥和海裡的魚。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必使惡人倒斃，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必剷除地上的人類。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這是耶和華說的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"text":"「我必伸手攻擊猶大，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"攻擊耶路撒冷的所有居民，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"清除巴力的殘跡及拜偶像之祭司的名號。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必剷除那些在屋頂祭拜天上萬象的人，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"剷除敬拜耶和華並憑祂起誓又憑米勒公起誓的人，","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"剷除離棄耶和華、不尋求祂、不求問祂的人。」","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"text":"要在主耶和華面前肅靜，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為耶和華的日子近了。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華已準備好祭物，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"潔淨了祂邀請的人。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華說：「在給耶和華獻祭之日，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必懲罰首領和王子，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以及所有穿外族服裝的人。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"到那日，我必懲罰所有跳過門檻","poem":1},{"noteId":0},{"text":"、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使主人的家充滿暴力和欺詐的人。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"到那日，魚門必傳出哭喊聲，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"新區必響起哀號聲，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"山陵必發出崩裂的巨響。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這是耶和華說的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"市場區的居民啊，哀哭吧！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為所有的商人必滅亡，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"所有做買賣的必被剷除。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"那時，我必提著燈巡察耶路撒冷，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"懲罰那些安於罪中的人。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們心想，『耶和華不賜福也不降禍。』","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們的財物必遭搶掠，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"家園必淪為廢墟。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們建造房屋，卻不能住在裡面；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"栽種葡萄園，卻喝不到葡萄酒。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"text":"「耶和華的大日子近了，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"近了，很快就到了。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"那將是痛苦的日子，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"勇士也必淒聲哀號。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"那是降烈怒的日子，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"是困苦艱難的日子，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"是摧殘毀壞的日子，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"是黑暗幽冥的日子，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"是陰霾密佈的日子，","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"是吹號吶喊、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"攻打堅城高壘的日子。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":[{"text":"「我要使災難臨到人類，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以致他們行路像瞎眼的，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為他們得罪了耶和華。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們的血必如灰塵般被倒出，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們的屍體必如糞便般被丟棄。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在耶和華發怒的日子，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們的金銀救不了他們。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂的怒火必吞噬大地，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂必驟然毀滅一切世人。」","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":0,"caller":"+","text":"「跳過門檻……的人」指祭拜偶像的人，參見撒母耳記上5·5。","reference":{"chapter":1,"verse":9}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ZEP/1.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ZEP/2.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/HAB/3.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":18}